WEBVTT

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:04.202
So next time you're lounging
on a tropical white-sand beach,

00:02:04.226 --> 00:02:06.543
maybe thank of parrotfish.

00:02:06.567 --> 00:02:07.718
(Laughter)

00:02:07.742 --> 00:02:10.686
Third, they have so much style.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.994
Mottled and striped,
teal, magenta,

00:02:13.018 --> 00:02:15.159
yellow, orange, polka-dotted,

00:02:15.183 --> 00:02:18.746
parrotfish are a big part
of what makes coral reefs so colorful.

00:02:19.212 --> 00:02:21.565
Plus, in true diva style,

00:02:21.589 --> 00:02:25.128
they have multiple wardrobe changes
throughout their life.

00:02:25.473 --> 00:02:26.631
A juvenile outfit,

00:02:26.655 --> 00:02:27.949
an intermediate getup,

00:02:27.973 --> 00:02:29.306
and a terminal look.

00:02:29.711 --> 00:02:35.058
Fourth, with this last wardrobe change
comes a sex change from female to male,